","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-guiding-values-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":3200,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlwAAABXRUJQVlA4IFAAAADwAQCdASoQAA0AA4BaJZwAAv05yKjMJAAA/uJpO/PXkgpwBz1HWuaSd1BlHu152MIEhGvKt6tg9wZQX1xChBu8g+sQPrCAcLbuVrlyqdIAAA=="},"video":null},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"Featured Projects","subheading":"Go beyond bricks and mortar","content":"<p>Our projects are the result of trust, close collaboration, and an uncompromising approach to quality. We undertake a limited number of projects at any one time, ensuring each home receives the time, focus, and care it deserves.</p>\n<p>As a family-owned builder with over 35 years of experience in Melbourne, we bring continuity, accountability, and proven capability to every project. The result is a portfolio of homes that are thoughtfully crafted. Projects defined by precision, care, and quiet excellence.</p>\n","cta":{"buttonLabel":"See all projects","type":"post","externalLink":false,"url":"/projects/"},"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"card-projects","layout":"2","source":"postType","sourcePostType":"projects","filter":"select","selectedPosts":[15],"cards":[{"heading":"Calibre","description":false,"label":"2025","link":{"target":false,"title":"Calibre","url":"/projects/calibre/"},"image":{"sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Kitchen-area-24-1-scaled-1.jpg","alt":"","width":"4000","height":"2666","blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmYAAABXRUJQVlA4IFoAAAAwAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZACdADPoBkDw2VzwAD+J7Bx6bMpzOXXi5YBnGl3DWZ8BfGUSktNQvOeEJAjkoQVGMzAHppRDlW76rWFf0WLP+6raYsRairh5UkcAAA="},"videoUrl":false}]},{"type":"card-projects","layout":"3","source":"postType","sourcePostType":"projects","filter":"select","selectedPosts":[287,291,279],"cards":[{"heading":"Obsidian","description":false,"label":"2025","link":{"target":false,"title":"Obsidian","url":"/projects/obsidian/"},"image":